</div>          </div>          <div n="1" type="jPoliticalNews">             <div n="2" type="jArticle" xml:id="a1b" prev="#a1a">                <p>einer Durch&#x017F;chnitts&#x017F;tärke von je 500 Mann. Nun<lb/>
